                        "cot": " \n\nFirst, what is a desert? A desert is a dry, barren area of land. \n\nNow, what is characterized by high sunshine? Something that is characterized by high sunshine is something that gets a lot of sun. \n\nSo, based on the information given, we can infer that deserts are characterized by high sunshine because they get a lot of sun.",
