                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To determine the best option for a reflector while running at night, let's analyze each option:\n\nA) A black shirt - Black is not a reflective color and will not help in making you visible at night. It will actually make you less visible, as it absorbs light.\n\nB) Kitchen foil - Kitchen foil is made of aluminum and has a shiny, reflective surface. This can be used as a reflector, as it will reflect light from sources like car headlights, making you more visible at night.\n\nC) Sunglasses - Sunglasses are designed to protect your eyes from sunlight, not to reflect light. They will not be effective as a reflector while running at night.\n\nD) A megaphone - A megaphone is a device used to amplify sound, not to reflect light. It will not be effective as a reflector while running at night.\n\nBased on this analysis, the best option for a reflector while running at night is:\n\nB) Kitchen foil",
