                    {
                        "id": "c4c38456-079b-4780-9228-c363a366fb9e",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-16",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Carnivores are animals that primarily eat other animals. They have adaptations such as sharp teeth and strong jaws to help them catch and consume their prey. Carnivores play a crucial role in the food chain by controlling the population of herbivores and maintaining balance in ecosystems.\n\nTo answer the original question, we need to evaluate each option and determine which one is true for carnivores.\n\nA) Carnivores eat foliage and vegetables exclusively.\nThis statement is false. Carnivores primarily eat other animals, not foliage or vegetables. Herbivores are the animals that eat foliage and vegetables exclusively.\n\nB) Carnivores are the bottom of the food chain.\nThis statement is false. Carnivores are not at the bottom of the food chain. They are usually in the middle or top of the food chain, depending on the ecosystem. Producers, such as plants, are at the bottom of the food chain, followed by herbivores.\n\nC) Carnivores require prey to survive.\nThis statement is true. Carnivores rely on other animals as their primary food source. They need to consume prey to obtain the necessary nutrients and energy to survive.\n\nD) Carnivores require carbon dioxide to survive.\nThis statement is false. Carnivores, like all animals, require oxygen to survive. Carbon dioxide is a waste product of cellular respiration, which is exhaled by animals. Plants, on the other hand, require carbon dioxide for photosynthesis.\n\nBased on the evaluation of each option, the correct answer is:\n\nC) Carnivores require prey to survive.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "a61d8ef3-fccc-4881-a991-5021780b22c2",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "C) Carnivores require prey to survive.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
