                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Question: Is Mercury suitable for use as a Slip N Slide material?\nA) True\nB) False\n\nStep 1: Understand the properties of Mercury\nMercury is a heavy, silvery-white liquid metal that is toxic and can cause severe health problems if ingested or absorbed through the skin.\n\nStep 2: Consider the requirements for a good Slip N Slide material\nA good Slip N Slide material should be safe, non-toxic, and provide a smooth and slippery surface for sliding.\n\nStep 3: Compare Mercury's properties to the requirements for a Slip N Slide material\nMercury is toxic and can cause severe health problems, which makes it unsafe for use as a Slip N Slide material.\n\nStep 4: Determine the answer\nBased on the comparison, Mercury is not suitable for use as a Slip N Slide material.\n\nAnswer: B) False",
