                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Question: Did the 40th president of the United States send lolcats to his friends?\nA) True\nB) False\n\nStep 1: Identify the 40th president of the United States.\nThe 40th president of the United States was Ronald Reagan, who served from 1981 to 1989.\n\nStep 2: Determine if lolcats existed during his presidency.\nLolcats are humorous images of cats with captions, typically shared on the internet. The phenomenon of lolcats became popular in the mid-2000s, well after Reagan's presidency.\n\nStep 3: Consider if it was possible for Reagan to forward lolcats to his friends.\nSince lolcats did not exist during Reagan's presidency and the internet was not widely used for sharing images at that time, it is highly unlikely that he could have forwarded lolcats to his friends.\n\nAnswer: B) False",
