                        "cot": " \n\nStep 1: Gravity is a force that pulls objects together. \n\nStep 2: In the formation of stars, gravity pulls together gases and dust particles. \n\nStep 3: This causes the gases and dust particles to condense into spheres. \n\nAnswer: B) Gravity causes gases and dust particles to condense into spheres.",
