                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nAnswer: B) Gravity causes gases and dust particles to condense into spheres.\n\nPlan:\n1. Read each statement carefully and consider what role gravity plays in each.\n2. Eliminate any statements that are not related to the formation of stars.\n3. Consider the role of gravity in the formation of stars.\n4. Compare the remaining statements to the role of gravity in the formation of stars.\n5. Select the statement that best describes the role of gravity in the formation of stars.\n\nConclusion: B) Gravity causes gases and dust particles to condense into spheres.",
