                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nQuestion: Which of the following statements best describes the role of gravity in the formation of stars?\n\nAnswer: B) Gravity causes gases and dust particles to condense into spheres.\n\nExplanation: Gravity plays an important role in the formation of stars. It is the force that pulls together the gas and dust particles in a nebula, causing them to collapse and form a sphere. This sphere then continues to collapse under its own gravity, eventually forming a star.",
