                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStudent: What is the rock cycle?\n\nProfessor: The rock cycle is the process by which rocks are created, transformed, and destroyed.\n\nStudent: How does an igneous rock form?\n\nProfessor: Igneous rocks form from molten rock, or magma, that cools and solidifies. Magma can form from either the melting of existing rocks or the decomposition of organic matter.",
