                    {
                        "id": "eda5262b-7f2f-4cd4-aa27-9b459b83aec4",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-16",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "To answer this question, we need to understand the process of sedimentary rock formation and the role of each step in this process. Sedimentary rocks are formed from the accumulation and cementation of mineral and organic particles, which are products of weathering and erosion of pre-existing rocks or the remains of organisms. The process of sedimentary rock formation can be divided into several stages:\n\n1. Weathering: The breakdown of rocks into smaller particles due to physical, chemical, or biological processes.\n2. Erosion: The transportation of weathered rock particles by water, wind, or ice.\n3. Deposition: The settling of eroded particles in a new location, such as the ocean floor.\n4. Burial: The accumulation of more layers of sediment on top of the deposited layer, increasing pressure and temperature.\n5. Lithification: The transformation of loose sediment into solid rock through compaction and cementation.\n\nNow that we have a clear understanding of the process, let's address the original question:\n\nWhen a layer of sediment is deposited on the ocean floor, what is the next step in the formation of sedimentary rocks?\n\nSince the sediment has already been deposited on the ocean floor, the next step in the process is burial (option B). This involves the accumulation of more layers of sediment on top of the deposited layer, which increases pressure and temperature, eventually leading to lithification and the formation of sedimentary rocks.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "662049ee-1281-4ab3-a2ea-db75ff74cd06",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "B) burying.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/04/13 07:04:21",
                        "api_service": "openai_chat",
                        "model": "{'name': 'gpt-4', 'temperature': 0, 'max_tokens': 512}",
