                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nQuestion:\n\nWhat effect could extensive glaciation have had on ocean ecosystems that might explain extinctions at the end of the Permian period?\n\nPossible answers:\n\nA) A steep drop in ocean salinity and density.\n\nB) A steep drop in ocean volume and area.\n\nC) Increased exposure of oceans to ultraviolet radiation.\n\nD) Increased exposure of tsunamis to ocean life.",
