                        "cot": " \n\nFirst, we need to identify what is meant by \"gravitational energy.\" Gravitational energy is the energy that an object has due to its position in a gravitational field. \n\nNext, we need to identify which of the given alternative energy resources use gravitational energy. Tidal energy and hydropower both use gravitational energy, as does geothermal energy. \n\nTherefore, the correct answer is A) tidal energy and hydropower.",
