                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStudent: What is the difference between frequency and amplitude?\n\nProfessor: Frequency is the number of waves that pass a given point in a given amount of time, while amplitude is the height of the wave. So, if two sound waves have the same pitch, the one with the greater amplitude will be louder.\n\nStudent: So, which of the properties is greater for the second sound wave?\n\nProfessor: The second sound wave has a greater amplitude, so it is louder. The other properties, frequency, wavelength, and speed in air, are the same for both sound waves.",
